From 7711cba850251a2872b17e9275202e9c9fa3b4fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR Recomp <noreply@lr-recomp.invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:10:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 050/108] gpu: vulkan: GPU time of each draw in the traced
 frame (vulkan_gpu_trace_frame)

A timestamp after every draw of the traced frame; the 10-s log lists the
slowest draws (shader hashes, primitive, index count, pass signature) and
GPU time per pixel shader. Inside render passes the times are only
indicative when the driver renders the pass in tiles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

